-------------------------------------------------

WWBBSChat v1.85
Chat programs for WWBBS

-------------------------------------------------

Use
DOSCOMMAND WWBBS:WWBBSChat $NODE
in WWBBS command menu`

WWBBSChat ?
NODE/A,MODE/N,MAXROWS=R/N,MAXCOLUMNS=C/N,FILEMSG,WINDOW

NODE/A          Node name

MODE/N          Select Chat Mode 1-7, default WWBBSChat ask Sysop
                MODE=1 Classic Chat
                MODE=2 Line Chat
                MODE=3 LineNoBreak Chat
                MODE=4 Line Hide Chat
                MODE=5 Talk Chat (Only Ansi)
                MODE=6 Talk Scroll Chat (Only Ansi)
                MODE=7 Talk Fast Scroll Chat (Only Ansi)
                MODE=8 ?!??!?!??!?! If you want send a idea ;)

MAXROWS=R/N
MAXCOLUMNS=C/N  Max size of the Chat, default auto-detect

FILEMSG         Ascii file with string

WINDOW          Console Window for SysOp

Wait string, default "Please wait, I am calling Sysop";
Start string, default "Chat Sysop";
End string, default "End Chat Sysop";
Abort string, default "Abort";
NoSysop string, default "Sorry, Sysop is not here";
Help string, default "Help: CTRL-L redraw screen,CTRL-G send alarm,ESC exit chat";

WINDOW          Sysop WINDOW

Stop Time in ChatMode

Warning:

If bbs hang-up then WWBBSChat don't exit
WWBBSAUX: error in WaitForChar
